[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0001","text":"雾子。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0010","text":"听得见哦……\n风……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0020","text":"水……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0030","text":"光……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0040","text":"闪闪发亮……全部……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0050","text":"连接在一起……\n扩散开去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0060","text":"我也……一定……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0061","text":"雾子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0070","text":"辛苦了，雾子。\nPV拍摄，非常棒哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0080","text":"如果……我做得……够好的话……\n那就好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0090","text":"嗯，在勇者一行中，珍爱万物的白魔法师……\n感觉能感受到一阵温暖的风，非常适合雾子。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800800_01_0100","text":"呵呵……我也……\n吹到了……温暖的风……"}]
